<title>USA: FHLMC sets $150 Million of REMIC securities.</title>
<headline>FHLMC sets $150 Million of REMIC securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (Freddie Mac or FHLMC) said it issued $150 million of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC 1894, underwritten by Lehman, has a coupon of 8.0 percent and is backed by 30-year single-family fixed-rate mortgages, FHLMC said. The issue was priced on September 4 and has a settlement date of September 30, the agency said.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
